WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.350
The school festival...

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.110
...is over, huh?

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.730
I wanna go to Midi City...

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.280
Sorry! English is the pits!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.490
Huh? Everybody, what's wrong?

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.490
- I'm burned out...
- I wanna go to Midi City...

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.450
Don't all talk at once.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.960
Playing for two and half hours when we
only have three songs is a little too hard...

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:27.290
Seriously, how much of our
concert was talking? It was crazy!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.550
Thanks to that, I'm completely wiped out.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.680
I won't have anything to talk
about for another six months.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.890
Anyway, there was something
important I forgot to tell everyone.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.220
What is it?

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.310
At our performance at the school festival,

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:45.400
this old guy named Ogasawara gave
us tickets to the Grateful Rock Festival!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.560
What?!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.820
We can go to Midi City!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.370
<i>Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO!</i>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.210
<i>Love life! Very! Very! Happy!</i>

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:06.000
<i>Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping!</i>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.710
<i>Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK?</i>

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.670
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:17.300
<i>Rushing out onto the road to</i>
<i>school with the blue sky behind us</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.260
<i>I like that! I like this, too!</i>

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.770
<i>I'll take it all, all of it~</i>

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:25.640
<i>A girl who imagines love is all romance</i>

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>If I can attack, I'll do it boldly</i>

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:33.030
<i>Let's find an original vision for the future</i>

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>Sometimes, we'll have a secret love advice time</i>

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.790
<i>Who do you like?</i>

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:49.340
<i>You've got a green light for love now!</i>
<i>It's your chance to move forward!</i>

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.170
<i>So, let's just</i>

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.170
<i>Have a blast! Fall in love!</i>

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.260
<i>Our youth is non-stop!</i>

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.340
<i>Run! Aim for the future!</i>

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.970
<i>Everyone gather</i>

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.850
<i>For a happy ending!</i>

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:04.390
<i>Will tomorrow be happy or sad?</i>
<i>Will we idle our time away?</i>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.480
<i>We'll work hard!</i>

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.770
<i>I want to keep dreaming forever!</i>

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.980
<i>Let's fly out into the</i>
<i>world with all our strength!</i>

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:17.860
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:25.160
What? Dagger's planting them
at the Grateful Rock Festival?

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.540
Yes, that's right.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.340
Leave it to me.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:37.010
I can defeat guys like that easily.

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.840
Crow, are you still saying that?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:45.350
I know. You're trying to say that in order
to defeat the dark monsters—no, Dagger—

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.940
we have to use music, right?

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:54.530
My Ryukenden will not allow that Legend of
a Villain to enter the doors of the BooDooKan.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.400
Hence—

00:02:55.610 --> 00:03:01.570
The tune played by the Holy Ark of this
dark sun god will become a holy thunderbolt

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:05.790
that will convict Dagger,
the incarnation of evil.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.830
You all get it, huh?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.880
No matter what, we can't let that
legendary festival become defiled.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.090
Mr. Berry hasn't talked at all since then.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.260
I wonder what's happened to him.

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:29.390
Hey! Wake up, you perverted guitar bastard!

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.020
Don't do that!

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:39.070
It's probably my fault. I'm sorry.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.450
No, it's not your fault, Chuchu.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.820
Cyan...

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:47.580
Dagger, who tried to
brainwash you, is the one to blame.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.410
Yeah, pyuru!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.000
Thanks for saying that...

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.680
Genius!

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.680
King, the songs you write really are wonderful!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.900
Powerful, and overflowing with ecstatic joy.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:21.360
No matter where you look, you won't
find a song to beat this in Midi City.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.120
I am invincible!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.750
Oh, King. You're the best, after all.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:41.550
To use a petty trick like
brainwashing an innocent girl...

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.180
Just how sneaky can you get?

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:48.260
Sneaky? I'll take that as a compliment.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.430
If I win, it won't matter if I'm sneaky or not.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.850
Your clichéd plot failed, didn't it?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.440
Plot?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.320
I was just playing around.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:04.860
Besides, you're the one all worn
out from going along with it.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:09.200
As long as I have this song,
my goal might as well be accomplished.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.410
You'll be burned if you
underestimate her, you know.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:20.420
Your song can easily
overcome that helpless little girl.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:25.800
Anyway, I kept my end of the bargain.
Now, hurry up and release me!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:32.060
Hey! Bastard! Are you pretending
to not be able to hear me?

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.560
You really are a cheater,
you black jellyfish bastard!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:40.190
Oh? Are you all right?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:45.740
You're pretty naive to believe
a verbal agreement like that.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:53.540
You should just watch what unfolds at
the festival while locked up in that room.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:59.710
I'm sure it will be the best entertainment
since the beginning of Midi City.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.310
Wait, Dagger!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.780
I'm waiting for you, Cyan.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.790
Cyan...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.960
Don't lose.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:49.550
Since our performance in the
Grateful Rock Festival was decided,

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:55.270
I have been dutifully caring for my guitar
shamisen and refining my techniques.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.520
I have also devoted myself to
my bass shamisen and singing,

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.940
and I believe I have improved significantly.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:08.200
I admire your dedication to refining
your abilities on your instruments.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:13.660
But girls, have you forgotten
what is most important at the present?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:18.160
Thank you for your kind words,
Master, but what else can we do?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:24.340
After learning of that man's plots, I will also
put my fate on the line to destroy Dagger.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.800
Quiet!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.800
Our job is to spread music from the Far East.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:40.560
In order to do so, the most important factor
is to perform our music with all our hearts.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.150
No matter what crisis is in front of us,

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:50.530
as long as we remember that,
we can get rid of that threat.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.620
I misunderstood greatly.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.240
I apologize.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:08:01.620
Even so, girls, it does
not change your devotion.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.960
Use that as encouragement
and stand firm here.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.840
Now, let us break for luncheon.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.220
Yes, Master!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:19.640
Dagger, I will not allow you to
jeopardize the music of Midi City...!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.600
Kai, Riku.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.150
It's almost time for the festival.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.530
Yes, our preparations are complete!

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:33.320
All that's left is for us to shine as usual,

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:40.620
and fill the hearts of the fans with
pleasure, happiness, and excitement!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.080
Yes, we'll work hard to make that happen.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.110
BooDooKan...

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.950
We're finally here!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.200
Yeah.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.080
It's almost time, pyuru!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.660
We can actually perform here...!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.210
Damn, we're actually here!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.040
Yeah, I'm getting fired up, for real!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.010
This is surely the holy land of music.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.220
Legend of the Concert Hall. Hence—

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.560
It's Darudayu, pyuru!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.060
Oh?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:54.650
We met sometime ago... Let us give
our all on stage to our hearts' content.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.610
Okay, pyuru!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.910
By the way, Cyan...

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.330
Yes?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:06.080
No matter what happens,
believe in your own power.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.460
Huh?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.920
Hey...!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.800
There it is. The never-ending car.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:21.180
Shu☆zo! Kai! Riku!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.470
Hi, everyone!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:29.770
Please enjoy a brilliantly
shining concert today!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.280
Oh? You're that kitten from before.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.820
Oh, um... thank you for that...

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:40.780
No, we're the ones who should thank you.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.700
You're Plasmagica, right?

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.500
You guys are the hottest
band in Midi City right now.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:51.750
Huh? Oh, thank you...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.760
Let's have fun at the concert together today!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:05.350
Show me your soul, for real, Rom.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:10.940
For today's performance,
we're seriously out to win, Shu.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.860
Mr. Berry, it's finally time.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:24.490
Now that I think about it, the president
and Angelica aren't here yet, are they?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:29.000
They said they'd rush over
after taking care of some business.

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.920
Some business, pyuru?

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.170
Let's go, Angelica!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:40.880
All right, President.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.970
Please hold on tight.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.030
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:10.410
It's finally time to begin
the Grateful Rock Festival,

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.580
organized by the great musician born
from Midi City, Grateful King!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.090
Everyone, are you ready?

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.130
Please drink this if you'd like.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.720
Oh, thank you!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.760
I'm glad we could meet again!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.970
There's a lot more where that came from.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.020
However! You can only
have two bottles for free.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.480
No wonder you're number one in sales.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.900
Let's liven up today's concert together!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:39.740
Yeah!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:40.740
Yes!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.780
Let's have fun, pyuru!

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.320
We're coming in!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.330
Marimari! Tsugihagi!

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:51.960
H-Here are some snacks...

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.500
Thanks!

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.340
Oh, it's really been a while!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:02.630
I'm so happy to be able to stand
on the same stage as everyone today!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.640
Y-Yeah.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:10.390
Everyone's looking forward
to the festival so much, but...

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:17.230
First up is the band firmly in
the number one spot in Midi City—

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.150
Trichronika!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.780
♪ I know what the real you... ♪

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:31.370
For us to participate in such a great festival,

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:36.830
well, it's like the world has
finally caught up to the great me...

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:43.670
Even so, the one you worship second
only to this dark sun god, Grateful King,

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.720
does not have his name
on the list of participants...

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:50.310
Does that mean he will not
descend upon this place today?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.520
There was a part I really wanted
to respond to in the middle,

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:55.640
but well, I'll indulge him for today.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.150
But didn't you know?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.730
There's a rumor that Grateful King
has been holed up in a <i>great</i> studio

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:06.860
to focus <i>great</i> ly on writing
his <i>great</i> song lately.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:10.700
Hence, he is unable to appear today?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:15.330
Yeah, but he could still
make an unplanned appearance.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.880
If that happened, maybe he'd
have a jam session with me...?

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:23.460
I mean, the only one who could
play with King is the great me.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.130
What'll we do, Rom?

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.220
Hey, Rom!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.220
What're you doing?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.520
Oh, uh, it's almost time for us to go on.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.560
All right, let's do this!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:46.490
Next, we have the band firing up
Midi City with their crimson mind's eyes—

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.740
SHINGANCRIMSONZ!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.830
Thanks for waiting, you cattle!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.540
Say that again!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.040
Now that I think about it,
I haven't seen Cri-Cri.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.340
If they were here,
they'd have come to see us already.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.630
Are they late on such an important day, pyuru?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:10.090
I don't think they would <i>not</i> come, though...

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.520
I'm sorry.

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:19.900
Don't worry, Cyan.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.320
We're here with you, too.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.400
You're not alone, pyuru.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.950
Yeah. Thanks, everyone!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:38.080
They have come to Midi City to
spread the sound of the Far East—

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.500
They took everyone's
hearts hostage in an instant—

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:44.210
It's time for Tsurezurenaru Ayatsuri Mugenan!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:51.970
♪ The dream fireworks blooming
in the never-ending sky ♪

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:58.850
♪ The steam whistle of the night train blows ♪

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.980
♪ My heart is expectant and uneasy ♪

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.780
♪ In the dry night ♪

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.320
♪ I feel like something is about to happen ♪

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.330
♪ And I take a step in response ♪

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.120
♪ The faraway sk— ♪

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.750
Wh-What's going on?!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.210
Don't tell me...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.900
It has begun...

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.370
Girls, brace yourselves.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.200
- Master!
- Master!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.750
Dagger has finally made his move.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.630
What's going on?

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.340
This is...

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.640
Don't tell me it's another dark monster, pyuru?!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:18.810
Cyan!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.810
Huh? We—

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.640
Oh, Darudayu!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:27.810
Oh? This is reassuring.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:32.320
However, our enemy tonight is a
ruffian unlike any we've ever faced before.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.900
You must not let your guard down!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.660
Shu☆zo!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.460
Where is it?!

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:51.550
Master!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.510
Has it come?

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.770
There it is!

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.780
Kai, Riku! Get behind me!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.620
I will go after it.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.220
Crow!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:43.930
Jump!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.100
Kai! Riku!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.030
Everyone!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:03.580
Damn it, I can't move...

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.700
Everyone... What should I do...?

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.790
Kitten!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.130
Work together with me to defeat that thing!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.170
I would like you to leave it to me.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.260
Darudayu!

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:22.510
You two should save your strength for
the great battle that will come after this.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:23.390
But—

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:29.560
Do not worry. I am more than enough
for a monster like that by myself.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.360
All those in the way are gone.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:36.440
Dark monster, capture those three!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:45.700
Have a taste of the spirit
of the music of the Far East!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.960
♪ The steam whistle of the night train blows ♪

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.110
Now, I will go!

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.550
Darudayu!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.300
Amazing...

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.170
Huh?

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.930
It is time for us to part in this life.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:30.770
Prepare yourself!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.810
Help!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.230
Rosia?!

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:42.690
Darudayu! You can't kill her!

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.610
Cyan?

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.870
No way...

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.710
Don't tell me Rosia is...

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:03.970
<i>If you like it, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:06.840
